1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:03,112
(Penny:)I think it's so adorable you're
making Sheldon breakfast.

2
00:00:03,113 --> 00:00:05,183
(Leonard:)Well, he's having
a rough time.

3
00:00:05,181 --> 00:00:06,581
(Leonard:)Amy broke his heart,

4
00:00:06,583 --> 00:00:09,683
(Leonard:)the DVR cut off the last minute
of Doctor Who...

5
00:00:09,686 --> 00:00:12,386
(Leonard:)that crow followed him home.

6
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:16,859
(Penny:)Aren't you worried you're making
French toast on oatmeal day?

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:19,430
(Leonard:)Ah, well, what's this?
A pot of oatmeal?

8
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:23,469
(Leonard:)Or, thanks to you, what
I will now call "gloatmeal."

9
00:00:23,466 --> 00:00:26,536
(Penny:)Oh, I don't want credit
for that.

10
00:00:27,536 --> 00:00:29,336
(Sheldon:)Oh, Dr. and Mrs. Hofstadter,

11
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:31,509
(Sheldon:)lovely to see you
this fine morning.

12
00:00:31,508 --> 00:00:32,578
(Leonard:)You're in a good mood.

13
00:00:32,575 --> 00:00:33,845
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I am indeed.

14
00:00:33,843 --> 00:00:35,313
(Sheldon:)I have decided,

15
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:37,342
(Sheldon:)instead of wallowing
in sadness about Amy,

16
00:00:37,347 --> 00:00:40,617
(Sheldon:)it is time that I find myself
a new female companion.

17
00:00:40,617 --> 00:00:41,817
(Penny:)Oh. Good for you.

18
00:00:41,818 --> 00:00:43,318
(Leonard:)What brought this on?

19
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,690
(Sheldon:)I realized something...
when Amy was in my life,

20
00:00:45,689 --> 00:00:48,059
(Sheldon:)I was hyper-focused on my work
and ignored her.

21
00:00:48,058 --> 00:00:49,228
(Penny:)And you don't want

22
00:00:49,225 --> 00:00:51,295
(Penny:)to make the same mistake
with the next woman.

23
00:00:51,294 --> 00:00:53,894
No, I need a new woman
in my life to ignore

24
00:00:53,897 --> 00:00:56,197
(Sheldon:)so I can hyper-focus
on my work again.

25
00:00:56,199 --> 00:00:58,469
(Leonard:)Hey, I made
French toast sticks.

26
00:00:58,468 --> 00:00:59,938
(Penny:)On oatmeal day?

27
00:00:59,936 --> 00:01:02,366
(Leonard:)Ah, I also made oatmeal.
Ooh,

28
00:01:02,372 --> 00:01:05,372
(Sheldon:)that's a lot of carbohydrates
for a man on the prowl.

29
00:01:05,375 --> 00:01:07,445
(Sheldon:)You know what?
You eat it; you're married...

30
00:01:07,444 --> 00:01:09,814
(Sheldon:)it doesn't matter
what you look like.

31
00:01:11,013 --> 00:01:14,913
(Penny:)Don't take advice from a man
who threw his shoe at a crow.

32
00:01:16,251 --> 00:01:19,891
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

